@startuml 10_composants
!include style.iuml
title GSB-CR — Diagramme de composants (assemblages .NET et interfaces)
left to right direction

component "GSB.CR.IHM\n<<executable WinForms>>" as IHM
component "GSB.CR.Metier\n<<bibliothèque>>" as Metier
component "GSB.CR.Donnees\n<<bibliothèque>>" as Donnees
component "Oracle.ManagedDataAccess.Core\n<<NuGet>>" as Odp
database "Oracle\nschéma GSB" as Bdd

interface "Services" as ISvc
interface "IDao" as IDao
interface "ADO.NET" as IAdo

IHM --( ISvc
ISvc -- Metier
Metier --( IDao
IDao -- Donnees
Donnees --( IAdo
IAdo -- Odp
Odp --> Bdd : Oracle Net\nTCP 1521

component "GSB.CR.Modeles\n<<bibliothèque>>" as Modeles
component "Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration\n<<NuGet>>" as Conf
component "GSB.CR.Tests\n<<MSTest>>" as Tests

IHM ..> Modeles
Metier ..> Modeles
Donnees ..> Modeles
Donnees ..> Conf : lit appsettings
Tests ..> Metier : unitaires\n(faux DAO)
Tests ..> Donnees : intégration

legend right
  |= Interface |= Réalisée par |
  | Services | ServiceAuthentification, ServiceRapports, ServiceConsultation,\nServiceActivite, ServiceEquipe, ServiceEchantillons,\nServiceMessagerie, ServiceAdministration |
  | IDao | ICollaborateurDao, IRapportDao, IReferentielDao, IConsultationDao,\nIActiviteDao, IEquipeDao, IEchantillonDao, IMessagerieDao,\nIAdministrationDao |
  | ADO.NET | OracleConnection, OracleCommand, OracleTransaction |
  La couche Métier ne dépend que des interfaces DAO : testée sans Oracle.
endlegend
@enduml
